Pywel Atlas combined v0.58 map markers - one native Bell icon (type 360) per not-completed Bell and one chest icon (type 226) per not-opened chest of the game's dedicated chest levels in the detected save, shown at every map zoom (zoom limit off on our own markers only); Greymane Shrine markers paused; up to 256 markers per category, checked 32 per map update; F10 hides all, F6 shows again. A failed marker is retried every 5 s without blocking others. Observation: zoom windows per icon type, map zoom on F8, player position from the minimap, world-create records (ours and the game's own shrine/Bell icons)
